[00:00.00]Cinderella - 林俊杰 (JJ Lin)
[00:04.42]Lyrics by：林俊杰
[00:08.84]Composed by：林俊杰
[00:13.26]Arranged by：Terence Teo
[00:17.68]Produced by：李偲菘
[00:22.11]It doesn't impress her that he's got the best ride
[00:27.50]他那最豪华的座驾也没能打动她
[00:27.50]It doesn't impress her cos she's seen all the lies
[00:32.94]而她并不在意 她看穿了所有虚情假意
[00:32.94]Independent poised elegant smile
[00:38.20]那无拘无束 从容淡定 优雅迷人的微笑
[00:38.20]She is everything and more oh
[00:43.05]她是我的全部
[00:43.05]Fighter by day lover by night
[00:48.35]白天的战士 午夜的情人
[00:48.35]Ooh she's a cinderella
[00:51.47]她真像灰姑娘辛德瑞拉
[00:51.47]But only on the outside
[00:54.15]但那只是表面上
[00:54.15]Cos once you find your way inside
[00:58.47]如果你打开她的心扉
[00:58.47]You will see she's just the gullible girl
[01:06.12]你会发现她只是个天真的女孩
[01:06.12]She's awfully swell
[01:08.56]她是那么的美丽动人
[01:08.56]She does everything well
[01:11.41]她是那样的多才多艺
[01:11.41]She moves to the house on the dance floor
[01:14.70]她在宫殿的舞池上翩翩起舞
[01:14.70]While I'm swinging nine to four
[01:16.68]当我把身子轻轻摇
[01:16.68]And she would go ah ah aha
[01:19.50]她就乐得咯咯笑
[01:19.50]While I go la la la la
[01:22.16]当我啦啦啦把歌唱
[01:22.16]A sip of a wine
[01:23.50]她就微微啜口酒
[01:23.50]There's plenty of time
[01:24.95]有充裕的时间与她相伴
[01:24.95]The pleasure is mine
[01:27.22]我是那么欢乐
[01:27.22]She's so awfully swell
[01:29.92]她是多么伶俐啊
[01:29.92]And she knows me so well
[01:32.68]她深深明白我的心
[01:32.68]And she'd go singing on the sofa
[01:35.93]她在沙发上唱起歌来
[01:35.93]While I'm strumming my guitar
[01:38.10]当我拨动六弦的吉他
[01:38.10]I'm feeling some jazz tonight
[01:40.77]我感到一种爵士的曲调
[01:40.77]So turn out the lights
[01:43.63]把灯关了吧
[01:43.63]Under the stars
[01:45.00]在星空之下
[01:45.00]There we will lie
[01:46.11]我们躺在一起
[01:46.11]Our love goes sky high
[01:48.65]我们的爱愈发浓郁
[01:48.65]There's our sweet lullaby
